        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Unsealed Pact</strong>, every decision pushes you deeper into a world shaped by ritual magic, unpredictable allies, and dangerous choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wield a deck of more than <strong>200 cards</strong>, each influencing the battlefield in unique ways—but the creatures you summon do not obey direct orders. They act autonomously, reacting to threats, opportunities, and their own personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to manipulate the chaos:<br>shape your deck, control the flow of battle, and take calculated risks as enemies grow stronger and your options narrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore branching routes where you can <strong>spend HP or gold to change your path</strong>, opening shortcuts, avoiding threats, or confronting powerful elites for greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over <strong>200 relics and potions</strong>, procedurally generated encounters, and highly replayable runs, every pact you make tells a new story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎴 <strong>Build Your Strategy — 200+ Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with a massive card pool covering:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoning contracts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status manipulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-turn combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-risk, high-reward rituals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run opens new synergies and unexpected combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/1bc01ca81791dd2f9c0dcdc68f839873.poster.avif?t=1763380132\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/1bc01ca81791dd2f9c0dcdc68f839873.webm?t=1763380132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/1bc01ca81791dd2f9c0dcdc68f839873.mp4?t=1763380132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔮 <strong>Autonomous Summons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your creatures fight independently, each with its own behavior and priorities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive types dive into danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defenders protect you and intercept attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support units heal, buff, or debuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unstable entities may surprise both you and your enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering how to influence—rather than control—them is the core challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/7cbc0f1180401c8942340b35ec1e45c3.poster.avif?t=1763380132\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/7cbc0f1180401c8942340b35ec1e45c3.webm?t=1763380132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/7cbc0f1180401c8942340b35ec1e45c3.mp4?t=1763380132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧪 <strong>200+ Relics and Potions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect rare artifacts and powerful consumables that dramatically alter gameplay:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent stat boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minion-enhancing relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos-driven effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emergency potions for decisive moments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your relic build can completely redefine your deck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗺️ <strong>Shape Your Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend <strong>HP or gold</strong> to redirect your route in the overworld:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek  for greater rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid dangerous encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach merchants or rest sites early</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your route is no longer random—you can pay to rewrite fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/2fbe544522b1acf4c7a15b63881f6186.poster.avif?t=1763380132\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/2fbe544522b1acf4c7a15b63881f6186.webm?t=1763380132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/2fbe544522b1acf4c7a15b63881f6186.mp4?t=1763380132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ <strong>Tactical, Unpredictable Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to unfolding situations as enemies react, minions act on their own, and your deck evolves throughout the run.<br>No two battles play the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >♾️ <strong>Replayability Through Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With randomized maps, encounters, events, relics, card rewards, and minion behaviors, every run is a fresh challenge.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Unsealed Pact</strong>, every decision pushes you deeper into a world shaped by ritual magic, unpredictable allies, and dangerous choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wield a deck of more than <strong>200 cards</strong>, each influencing the battlefield in unique ways—but the creatures you summon do not obey direct orders. They act autonomously, reacting to threats, opportunities, and their own personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to manipulate the chaos:<br>shape your deck, control the flow of battle, and take calculated risks as enemies grow stronger and your options narrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore branching routes where you can <strong>spend HP or gold to change your path</strong>, opening shortcuts, avoiding threats, or confronting powerful elites for greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over <strong>200 relics and potions</strong>, procedurally generated encounters, and highly replayable runs, every pact you make tells a new story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎴 <strong>Build Your Strategy — 200+ Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with a massive card pool covering:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoning contracts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status manipulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-turn combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-risk, high-reward rituals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run opens new synergies and unexpected combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/1bc01ca81791dd2f9c0dcdc68f839873.poster.avif?t=1763380132\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/1bc01ca81791dd2f9c0dcdc68f839873.webm?t=1763380132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/1bc01ca81791dd2f9c0dcdc68f839873.mp4?t=1763380132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔮 <strong>Autonomous Summons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your creatures fight independently, each with its own behavior and priorities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive types dive into danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defenders protect you and intercept attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support units heal, buff, or debuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unstable entities may surprise both you and your enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering how to influence—rather than control—them is the core challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/7cbc0f1180401c8942340b35ec1e45c3.poster.avif?t=1763380132\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/7cbc0f1180401c8942340b35ec1e45c3.webm?t=1763380132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/7cbc0f1180401c8942340b35ec1e45c3.mp4?t=1763380132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧪 <strong>200+ Relics and Potions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect rare artifacts and powerful consumables that dramatically alter gameplay:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent stat boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minion-enhancing relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos-driven effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emergency potions for decisive moments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your relic build can completely redefine your deck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗺️ <strong>Shape Your Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend <strong>HP or gold</strong> to redirect your route in the overworld:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek  for greater rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid dangerous encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach merchants or rest sites early</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your route is no longer random—you can pay to rewrite fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/2fbe544522b1acf4c7a15b63881f6186.poster.avif?t=1763380132\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/2fbe544522b1acf4c7a15b63881f6186.webm?t=1763380132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/extras/2fbe544522b1acf4c7a15b63881f6186.mp4?t=1763380132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ <strong>Tactical, Unpredictable Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to unfolding situations as enemies react, minions act on their own, and your deck evolves throughout the run.<br>No two battles play the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >♾️ <strong>Replayability Through Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With randomized maps, encounters, events, relics, card rewards, and minion behaviors, every run is a fresh challenge.</p>",
